-- Curated one-time EGAT Label No.5 snapshot verified 2026-08-30.
-- 361 imported records: 80 AC wall/inverter, 80 refrigerators, 80 washers, 80 water heaters, 41 rice cookers.
-- Catalog fingerprint algorithm: join with ASCII unit separator the literal 'egat-spec-v1', category slug,
-- brand, model, calculation method, ECMAScript shortest decimal strings for rated/annual/per-cycle energy
-- and capacity (empty for NULL), capacity unit, and efficiency label; hash the UTF-8 bytes with 64-bit
-- FNV-1a and use the low 12 lowercase hexadecimal digits.
-- Exact source-row duplicates were removed before deterministic brand-balanced curation;
-- the water-heater slice retains both direct-watt variants of ALPHA EVO-EM.
-- Rekey statements preserve IDs if the prior review-round fingerprint snapshot was applied.
